  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A loudspeaker moves to the left at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{7}\"></span>, where <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> is the speed of sound in air. It emits sound of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. A stationary observer is in front of the loudspeaker.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which of the following gives the observed frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{\\text{obs}}\"></span> heard by the observer?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{\\text{obs}} = \\dfrac{7}{6}f\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{\\text{obs}} = \\dfrac{6}{7}f\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{\\text{obs}} = \\dfrac{8}{7}f\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{\\text{obs}} = \\dfrac{7}{8}f\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
